<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Delta Air Lines said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Delta Air Lines said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette downgraded Delta Air Lines Inc to outperform from recommended, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/8 to 68-5/8.</p>
</text>
